  data: {
    LLM: "1. Lead: The player to the dealer's right leads the first card.\n2. Must Follow Suit: Players must follow the suit led. If they cannot, they may play any card.\n3. Trumps: Trumps are only active once the hidden trump card is revealed. A player who cannot follow suit may ask to 'Reveal Trumps'.",
    Player: "1. Lead: The player to the dealer's right leads the first card.\n2. Must Follow Suit: Players must follow the suit led. If they cannot, they may play any card.\n3. Trumps: Trumps are only active once the hidden trump card is revealed. A player who cannot follow suit may ask to 'Reveal Trumps'.",
    objective: 'Win tricks to capture card points. The bidding team must reach their declared point total to win the round.',
